 "captions": {
  "n01": [
   "It’s 10:02.",
   "Minh is in a meeting.",
   "And the phone? On silent."
  ],
  "n02": [
   "At the door, Tuan is waiting, air fryer in hand.",
   "One call. Two calls…",
   "Nothing."
  ],
  "n03": [
   "Seventeen more stops are waiting.",
   "So the parcel goes back on the bike.",
   "And all that’s left is two sad little words:",
   "No answer."
  ],
  "n04": [
   "We’ve all been Minh.",
   "And we’ve all felt a little bad for Tuan."
  ],
  "n05": [
   "So we built Alodi.",
   "An AI agent that rescues failed deliveries,",
   "so the second try actually lands."
  ],
  "n06": [
   "Here’s how it works.",
   "Tuan taps one button.",
   "No typing. No calling back.",
   "And off to the next stop."
  ],
  "n07": [
   "From here, Alodi takes over.",
   "First, a friendly message to Minh, right away."
  ],
  "n08": [
   "An hour later? Still quiet.",
   "So Alodi does something lovely.",
   "It picks up the phone."
  ],
  "a01": [
   "“Hi Minh! This is Alodi, your delivery assistant.",
   "This call is recorded.",
   "When’s a good time?”"
  ],
  "m01": [
   "“Oh, sorry! Tomorrow after five, please.",
   "Leave it with security in Tower B.",
   "Or call my wife.”"
  ],
  "n09": [
   "Did you catch all that? Alodi did.",
   "When. Where. Who.",
   "All in one neat little card."
  ],
  "n10": [
   "It checks the rules,",
   "then sends the card straight to the next shipper’s phone."
  ],
  "n11": [
   "And the next evening?",
   "No calls. No guessing.",
   "Just… delivered."
  ],
  "n12": [
   "Minh gets the parcel.",
   "The shipper saves a trip.",
   "The seller keeps the sale."
  ],
  "n13": [
   "Already agreed a new time at the door?",
   "Tuan holds the button and says it, in ten seconds.",
   "Alodi writes the same card."
  ],
  "n14": [
   "And when an answer isn’t clear, or a buyer says no?",
   "Alodi stops, and asks a person.",
   "Because some calls should stay human."
  ],
  "n15": [
   "Meanwhile, the hub sees every rescue,",
   "live, on one dashboard."
  ],
